ip over in a flash!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_062"],["stg",0,null,-30.0,1.2,"OutQuad",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.7],["mrt",1,"z","013","star",null],["say","avg3_100","Teresa, Freesia, Donna! Wish you all smooth sailing in your courier work!",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.4],["clear",1,0.6,1],["show","avg1_125","a","002",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_127","a","002",0.7,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_130","a","002",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.05,"OutQuad",0.6,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_125","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["ctl","avg1_127","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["ctl","avg1_130","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_130","a","003","flower",null,null,null,null,"youzai","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_130","Thanks! And if anyone needs something delivered, send a commission to Post Haste!",0,""],["w",1.0],["film",0],["stg",0,null,-100.0,1.15,"OutQuad",1.2,null,null,null],["w",1.5],["say","0","To meet, to bond, and eventually to part... That moment is inevitable. Yet, the girl's voice holds no sorrow... Her expression is as warm and open as the clear blue sky.",3,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","story_main_03_008_d",0,0.0],["cbg",0,50.0,150.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,-50.0,null,1.1,"Linear",15.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.3],["w",1],["say","0","She knows that as long as she picks up a pen and sends a letter... Her heart will reach them.",3,""],["w",1.0],["film",1],["bg","BG_Black",0,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_177"],["w",1],["bg","posthouse_inside",0,1.0],["cbg",0,-100.0,100.0,1.2,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_130","a","002",null,-0.08,1.1,0,null,0.0],["w",1.5],["ctl","avg1_130","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_130","a","010","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",